v1 — FROZEN GRAPH. Do not edit here; edit workflows/mm_ifl_v1.json in the repo and run deploy.py.\n\nTwo image inputs only: FIRST FRAME (board still N — also sets generation size via GetImageSize) and LAST FRAME (board still N+1). The clip is pinned to open on the first and land on the last — continuity between beats is by construction, not prose. Identity comes from the approved board stills themselves; this graph has no reference slots."],"title":"📥 Inputs","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":165,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[930,-331],"size":[380,291],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### ✍️ Prompt Building\n\nPrompt comes from a line file (prompts/<unit>.lines): CUN_TextFileLineLoader (index = beat) → JWStringUnescape → MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo.prompt.\nNo <Picture N> tags here — there are no reference slots. The prompt describes the motion from the first frame to the last frame."],"title":"✍️ Prompt Building","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":166,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1420,-314],"size":[300,274],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 🧠 Models\n\nH3 int8 fl2va UNET, Qwen3-VL 32B nvfp4 encoder (type=minimax), video VAE fp16 + audio VAE fp32. Joint AV latent decoded twice, re-muxed by CreateVideo at 24 fps."],"title":"🧠 Models","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":167,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1760,-246],"size":[380,206],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 🔌 Conditioning\n\nMiniMaxH3ImageToVideo (FL2VA): first_frame + last_frame pin both ends of the clip. width/height are wired from GetImageSize on the FIRST frame — never typed. length is set per job by render.py (17k+5 grid). The prompt describes the motion BETWEEN the two stills."],"title":"🔌 Conditioning","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":168,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2250,-365],"size":[380,325],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 🎛️ Sampling\n\nres_multistep / simple, 20 steps, denoise 1.0 — the measured 20-step regime. Seed is FIXED (never randomize); render.py sets noise_seed from the job row."],"title":"🎛️ Sampling","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":169,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[4065,-178],"size":[300,138],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### Size\n\nGetImageSize on the FIRST frame → width/height."],"title":"Size","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":170,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[4405,-161],"size":[300,121],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 💾 Output\n\nSaveVideo filename_prefix is set per job by render.py (MovieMaker/<slug>/<unit>/clips/<beat>)."],"title":"💾 Output","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":171,"type":"MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo","pos":[1760,0],"size":[270,166],"flags":{},"order":22,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":306},{"name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":307},{"name":"first_frame","type":"IMAGE","link":311},{"name":"last_frame","type":"IMAGE","link":312},{"name":"prompt","type":"STRING","link":308,"widget":{"name":"prompt"}},{"name":"width","type":"INT","link":309,"widget":{"name":"width"}},{"name":"height","type":"INT","link":310,"widget":{"name":"height"}}],"outputs":[{"name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[313],"slot_index":0},{"name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","links":[314],"slot_index":1}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo"},"widgets_values":["",1344,768,311],"title":"IFL conditioning — first/last frame"},{"id":172,"type":"LoadImage","pos":[0,200],"size":[270,130],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"image","type":"COMBO","link":null,"widget":{"na